      "artist": "Jero~nlwiki",
      "description": "The purple and blue shirt was worn in the first years of Feyenoord when they still played under the name of Wilhelmina (1908–1909). The yellow and black shirt was worn after Wilhelmina changed their name to Celeritas (1909–1912). After the name change from Celeritas to Feijenoord in 1912 (and later Feyenoord), the red and white shirt started to become home kit colors.",
